# Windows W4: the native maximize hit target and the semantic Cambium control
# must name the same action. `scripts/windows-snap-receipt.ps1` holds this
# scenario while it probes WM_NCHITTEST and captures the visible Snap flyout.

log W4: opened the Cambium app frame for native Snap Layout inspection
assert snap window_frame == app
assert snap maximized == false
capture opened

await-release
wait 600
assert snap maximized == false

click role:button Maximize
settle 4
assert snap maximized == true
capture maximized

click role:button Maximize
settle 4
assert snap maximized == false
capture restored
log W4: native maximize hit and semantic control agree
